(B) Success and ambition can significantly shape one's legacy by determining the achievements and contributions left behind. Success often results in tangible accomplishments and advancements, while ambition drives continuous striving for excellence, inspiring others. Together, they can lead to a lasting impact, influencing future generations and setting a benchmark for others to follow.
